# One unqualified Compiler unit. This list is the only assembly order; do not glob sources into the unit.
# Order follows the dependency graph: lexer/foundation/MIR, AST/parser, Sema,
# lowering/emission/runtime bridges, Eval/Driver, then the single Jet entry.
# Native Host glue and the Rust bootstrap runner are intentionally excluded.

